  "description": "A beautiful, highly customizable circular progress bar control for .NET MAUI with multiple shapes (Circular, Arch, Flat), custom colors, rounded/flat edges, and smooth rendering. Perfect for dashboards, data visualization, and progress tracking in cross-platform applications.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
