  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Initial release v1.0.0 featuring:\n\t\t\t- ✅ Circular progress bar (360°) starting from top, moving clockwise\n\t\t\t- ✅ Arch progress bar (180° semi-circle) for gauge-style displays\n\t\t\t- ✅ Flat horizontal progress bar with rounded corners\n\t\t\t- ✅ Custom max progress values (not limited to 0-100 range)\n\t\t\t- ✅ Customizable colors for progress, background, and text\n\t\t\t- ✅ Show/hide text display option\n\t\t\t- ✅ Rounded and flat edge styles (LineCap.Round or LineCap.Butt)\n\t\t\t- ✅ Adjustable size and thickness for any design\n\t\t\t- ✅ Multi-layer support for creating complex donut charts\n\t\t\t- ✅ Full .NET 10 MAUI cross-platform support\n\t\t\t- ✅ Data binding support for MVVM pattern\n\t\t\t- ✅ Built with .NET MAUI Graphics for smooth performance\n\t\t\t- ✅ Comprehensive XML documentation for IntelliSense",
  "repository": "",
  "title": "Circular Progress Bar for .NET MAUI",
